    {
      "text": "A table titled \"EPI: Closed vial wastage rate - this and last 5 years\" for Trainingland, with one row per vaccine (BCG, DPT-HepB-Hib, IPV, MR, OPV, PCV, RV, TT, yellow fever) and one column per year; the year headings are too blurred to read. The first two columns are empty, and the four columns with data show rates between about 1.2% and 1.6% for every vaccine except IPV, at about 2.7-3%.",
